---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Zero Bite" description="Zero Bite helps you eat the food you've already bought, before it ends up in the bin." section="zerobite">
  <p class="overline">For iPhone</p>
  <h1>Waste less.<br>Cook more.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Zero Bite helps you eat the food you've already bought, before it ends up in the bin.</p>

  <img class="hero" src="/zerobite/header.png" alt="Zero Bite on iPhone: the Fridge screen with Spinach due today, and recipes using what's about to expire.">

  <div class="features">
  <div class="card"><strong>Scan the label</strong><p>Point the camera at a best-before or use-by date. A barcode fills in the product name.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><strong>Know what to use first</strong><p>Your fridge, freezer and cupboard sorted by urgency, with one-tap Used it and Freeze.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><strong>A nudge before it goes off</strong><p>Reminders before the date, on the day, and if something slips past.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><strong>Cook what's about to expire</strong><p>Recipes ranked by what's already in your fridge, expiring food first.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><strong>UK food recall alerts</strong><p>Warnings when a Food Standards Agency recall might affect something you've got.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><strong>Private by design</strong><p>No account, no ads, no tracking. Your food list stays on your phone.</p></div>
  </div>
</Base>
